# What 0.24's rename (tools/rename-vole.sh) keeps: the exclusions of
# `refactor extension` and `rewrite --text` (--exclude-from), one a line:
#   GLOB              a whole file (`*` any bytes, `/` too; DIR/: under it)
#   GLOB:/RE/         its lines RE matches
#   GLOB:/A/,/B/      from a line A matches to the line before the next B
# (RE: ^ $ . * + ? [a-z] \d \w; `\/` is a `/`). What is kept is history:
# what the releases up to 0.23 were called, and how they are built.

# The frozen seed: its tag builds 0.1.0, which reads .tach.
seed/

# Records of past releases and evals.
docs/eval/
docs/tool-gaps-*.md
docs/agent-tool-usage.md

# The release notes of the releases up to 0.23 (docs/releases.md).
docs/releases.md:/^### What's new in 0\.[0-9]$/,/^##/
docs/releases.md:/^### What's new in 0\.[0-9][^0-9]/,/^##/
docs/releases.md:/^### What's new in 0\.1[0-9]/,/^##/
docs/releases.md:/^### What's new in 0\.2[0-3]/,/^##/

# The chain: the releases up to 0.23 are tachyonc, .tach, their entries
# and the names of their interfaces.
bootstrap/releases.toml:/^\[seed\]/,/^# HEAD/
bootstrap/*:/up to 0\.23/
bootstrap/*:/tachyonc-0\.[0-9]/
bootstrap/*:/release\/tachyon/
bootstrap/bootstrap.sh:/all\.tach/

# The rename itself.
tools/rename-vole.sh
tools/rename-vole.keep

# The rename's own test: its fixture is in the old names on purpose.
tests/refactor/rename021.t
tests/refactor/rename021/
